{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENERGY DRAINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move, damage taken, and weapon overuse causes energy to deplete. Gain it back by eliminating enemies, and reaching the next dock.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/efdb8c99ae455d7c9fbcbb271411816b.poster.avif?t=1774066936\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/efdb8c99ae455d7c9fbcbb271411816b.webm?t=1774066936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/efdb8c99ae455d7c9fbcbb271411816b.mp4?t=1774066936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE SPACE DUNGEON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience close quarters combat in outer space. Battle through swarms of enemies as you crawl through corridors of asteroids. Collide too hard with the environment, and you're space debris.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/5e741152438590392c7f71ab31c5e805.poster.avif?t=1774066936\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/5e741152438590392c7f71ab31c5e805.webm?t=1774066936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/5e741152438590392c7f71ab31c5e805.mp4?t=1774066936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PURSUE GREATNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dock alive, score high, and climb the leaderboard. Actions throughout a run will determine your score. Devoid caters to a wide range of skill levels, while maintaining raw competitive integrity for the hardcore crowd.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/4b00f8f5529db2f723ea9adc1e78b028.poster.avif?t=1774066936\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/4b00f8f5529db2f723ea9adc1e78b028.webm?t=1774066936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/4b00f8f5529db2f723ea9adc1e78b028.mp4?t=1774066936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST TO STAY IN ORBIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s easy to get lost in space. Wishlist Devoid to receive important intel regarding development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/a2c1b5ae1c38ee38892b4d065213fd51.poster.avif?t=1774066936\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/a2c1b5ae1c38ee38892b4d065213fd51.webm?t=1774066936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/a2c1b5ae1c38ee38892b4d065213fd51.mp4?t=1774066936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111620?t=1774066936","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/cbd6b63672af6da1cc9ff868d17aab1d23539e77/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774066936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.st